---
import LegalPage from "../../../components/LegalPage.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Slot Recovery Privacy Policy | Brad Traversy";
const description =
	"Privacy policy for Slot Recovery, a Wix app by TravxLabs that helps businesses fill canceled appointment slots.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
	<LegalPage
		title="Privacy Policy"
		intro="This policy explains how Slot Recovery processes information when a business uses the app to manage requests for earlier Wix Bookings appointments."
		updated="August 5, 2026"
	>
		<section>
			<h2>1. Who we are</h2>
			<p>
				Slot Recovery is provided by <strong>TravxLabs</strong>, located at 7 Point
				Shore Road, Amesbury, Massachusetts 01913, United States. Questions about
				this policy or personal information can be sent to
				<a href="mailto:support@travxlabs.com">support@travxlabs.com</a>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>2. Scope of this policy</h2>
			<p>
				This policy applies to information processed through Slot Recovery. The Wix
				site owner who installs the app is responsible for its own privacy notices,
				booking practices, and communications with clients. Wix also processes data
				under its own terms and privacy policy.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>3. Information Slot Recovery processes</h2>
			<p>The app may process the following information:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Name and email address supplied by a client.</li>
				<li>Preferred appointment dates, times, staff, and location.</li>
				<li>The related Wix Bookings service and appointment information.</li>
				<li>Consent status, consent source, and consent timestamp.</li>
				<li>Recovery-offer status, response, expiration, and related booking references.</li>
				<li>Technical records needed to secure, operate, and troubleshoot the app.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>4. How we use information</h2>
			<p>Slot Recovery processes information only as needed to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Record a client's request to hear about an earlier appointment.</li>
				<li>Match eligible clients with canceled appointment slots.</li>
				<li>Create and validate private, expiring response links.</li>
				<li>Record whether a client accepts or declines an opening.</li>
				<li>Let the site owner review and confirm a booking.</li>
				<li>Prevent duplicate or invalid actions and troubleshoot the service.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Slot Recovery does not automatically contact clients, collect payment, or
				create a booking without separate confirmation by the site owner.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>5. Storage and sharing</h2>
			<p>
				Slot Recovery stores its app data within Wix infrastructure and uses Wix APIs
				to provide its features. TravxLabs does not operate a separate advertising
				database for this information. Information may be available to Wix and the
				relevant Wix site owner as needed to provide, secure, and support the app.
			</p>
			<p>
				We do not sell personal information, use it for third-party advertising, or
				share it with unrelated data brokers.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>6. Security</h2>
			<p>
				Slot Recovery uses Wix-hosted services, authenticated Wix requests, scoped app
				permissions, and access controls intended to prevent unauthorized use. Wix
				states that its platform encrypts data in transit and at rest. No online
				service can guarantee absolute security.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>7. Retention</h2>
			<p>
				Information is retained while it is reasonably needed to operate Slot
				Recovery, maintain consent and booking records, resolve disputes, meet legal
				obligations, and protect the service. A site owner can remove an active client
				from the recovery list. Additional deletion requests can be sent to
				<a href="mailto:support@travxlabs.com">support@travxlabs.com</a>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>8. Your choices and rights</h2>
			<p>
				Clients can decline an offered appointment and can ask the relevant site owner
				to stop contacting them. Depending on location, a person may also have rights
				to access, correct, delete, restrict, or receive a copy of personal
				information. Requests may be directed to the site owner or to
				<a href="mailto:support@travxlabs.com">support@travxlabs.com</a>. We may need
				to verify the request and coordinate with the site owner or Wix.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>9. Children</h2>
			<p>
				Slot Recovery is not directed to children under 13, and TravxLabs does not
				knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 through the
				app. Contact us if you believe such information has been submitted.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
			<p>
				We may update this policy to reflect changes to Slot Recovery, Wix platform
				requirements, or applicable law. The date at the top of this page shows when
				the policy was last updated.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>11. Contact</h2>
			<p>
				<strong>TravxLabs</strong><br />
				7 Point Shore Road<br />
				Amesbury, MA 01913<br />
				United States<br />
				<a href="mailto:support@travxlabs.com">support@travxlabs.com</a>
			</p>
		</section>
	</LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
